[b] July 29th Optimization&Fix Content: [/b]

Optimize the screenshot storage location reminder function;
Optimize the expression changes of character portraits;
Optimize chapter transition animation;
Fixed the unpredictable bug issue caused by short-term mouse clicking;
Fix the malfunction of the restore default settings button;
Fix some text errors;
Fix some voice error issues.

[b] Fixed on July 26th: [/b]
Fixed the issue where the transition animation of the personal line returning to the main interface cannot be played;
Fixed the issue where the page flipping shortcut key for historical records cannot be used properly;
Fix some text errors;
Fix some voice error issues.

[b] Fixed on July 25th: [/b]

Fix the issue of the archive interface not displaying;
Fixed the persistent issue of autoplay text;
Fixed the issue of overlapping probability options when reading archives;
Fix the issue where character voice settings cannot be triggered;
Fix individual shortcut key errors;
Fix some text errors;
Fix some voice error issues.

[b] Fixed on July 24th: [/b]
Fix the issue of logical errors in personal line jumping;
Fix the issue of history card screen;
Fixed the issue of multiple people synchronizing the vertical drawing display error;
Fix the issue where the vertical slider cannot be used;
Fix the issue of BGM disappearing from the personal line during clearance;
Fix the issue of personal line jumping errors;
Fix the issue of shortcut button judgment errors;
Fix some text errors;
Fix some voice error issues.

[b] Fixed on July 21st: [/b]
Fix the problem that adjusting windowing cannot pop up after unlocking the shortcut option bar;
Fix scene transitions that may cause stuttering, flashing, and issues;
Fixed the issue of no pop-up inquiry window when ESC exits or returns to the main interface;
Fix the issue of audio not playing;
Fix the problem of failed title switching and lagging switching in the bottom right corner of the main interface;
Fix the issue where the flowchart option cannot jump to the incoming line;
Fixed the issue where the game shortcut options bar did not pop up an inquiry window;
Fix the issue of display errors in vertical drawings;
Fix the issue of non inheritance settings;
Fix the malfunction of shortcut button function;
Fix the rollback function error issue;
Fix some text errors;
Fix some voice error issues.
